window.products.push({"id":899110,"name":"Holmes Velvet Plush Electric Heated Blanket King Size Sand Washable Auto Shut Off 10 Heat Settings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mg1R8XpXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Indulge in the rich softness of the Holmes Velvet Plush Heated Blanket, King Size Sand (BLV9KKS-R783-71B77). The beautiful ultra-soft velvety fabric is smooth to the touch. Stylish channel pattern and hemmed edges finish off the blanket with sophistication. Wrap yourself in luxurious warmth throughout the night. With 10 personalized heat settings, 10 hour auto-off and preheat settings, prepare for a restful night of soothing comfort and elegance. The thermofine warming system of the blanket monitors temperature and auto-adjusts to keep the level of warmth consistent throughout the night. Holmes blankets are a smart way to cut energy costs as well. They allow you to save up to 10 percent a year on your heating bills by turning on your heated blanket and setting your thermostat down by 10-15 percent for 8 hours while sleeping. The blanket is available in Twin, Full, Queen, and King sizes, with dual controls and split elements for the Queen and King sizes. For easy care, the blanket is fully machine washable and dryer safe. Also includes a Limited Warranty from Holmes . -Twin (62 in x 83 in) Single Control -Full (72 in x 83 in) Single Control-Queen (84 in x 89 in) Dual Controls -King (100 in x 89 in) Dual Controls *Note for Customers Outside of North America. These heated bedding products were made to work with 110V Electrical systems. If you live in a country that utilizes a different electrical system you may need to use a converter for these products to function. The act of using a converter automatically voids the warranty on these products. **All Holmes Blankets are rigorously tested and approved by a third party (UL or ETK Intertek) to comply with current industry safety standards. Please reference the included use and safety instructions to insure safe operation. Additional safety certification for this product can be viewed on the UL or Intertek websites or by calling their perspective customer care phone numbers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mg1R8XpXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holmes","source_asin":"B079Q7SLST","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-899110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079Q7SLST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079Q7SLST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
