window.products.push({"id":899470,"name":"Viking Culinary 4013-2002 3-Ply Sauce Pan, 2 Quart, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":77.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41m8bnAJIjL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Viking 3-ply Stainless Steel 2 qt. Sauce pan is designed for the culinary enthusiast desiring professional quality results. Handcrafted in the USA, Viking 3-ply Stainless Steel cookware is beautifully polished to a mirror finish. The 3-ply Stainless Steel clad design combines three layers of metal to create one solid piece that is formed into the vessel. An induction capable Stainless Steel exterior is bonded to a layer of aluminum alloy and then finished with a final layer of high quality 18/10 Stainless Steel on the interior. The three-layer construction combines the durability of stainless with the superior conductivity of aluminum, delivering even heat distribution along the bottom and throughout the sides of the pan. This makes the saucepan extremely responsive, essential in making hollandaise or other sauces requiring finesse and precision temperature control. Its Stainless Steel cooking surface is also non-reactive so there is no etching or interaction with sauces or other ingredients, especially ones high in acidity. The Viking-designed ergonomic handle takes stress off of the wrist, making cooking easier and enjoyable, while reducing heat transfer to keep the handle cool. The raised lid handle makes sure that it stays cool, allowing for space for use with oven mitt or towels. The NSF approved, non-porous inner layer of Stainless Steel makes it easy to clean and sanitize. Stove, oven, and grill friendly up to 600F degrees. Handcrafted in the USA with a limited lifetime .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41m8bnAJIjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Culinary","source_asin":"B00L9QG22O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-899470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L9QG22O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L9QG22O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":899471,"name":"Heather Ann Creations Heirloom Collection 2 Drawer Accent Storage Cabinet with Bottom Shelf, 33\" x 13\" x 32\", Beige/Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gWm+1WtCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Heather Ann Creations delivers again with their brand new \"Heirloom\" Collection. A collection of functional storage cabinets made with only the finest materials and painstakingly handcrafted from design to delivery. This collection boasts an array of colors and finishes to best suit any homes decor. The \"Heirloom\" collection console cabinets measure 32\" W x 13\" D x 33\" H and weights28lbs. Use the two elegant hooks/knobs on either end of the console to open 2 spacious drawers that individually measure 24.75\" W x 11\" D x 3.75\" H so you can store anything from your linen to car keys and anything in between. As well, use the shelf at the bottom of the console for additional cache space to store all of your treasures. The Heather Ann Heirloom collection brings you handcrafted and hand finished wood pieces that is sure to dazzle! Choose from beige stripped or wash to black wash as well as woodgrain and chevron styles and many more to best suit your decor. You will be sure to find the right console that best suits your motif within out extensive \"Heirloom\" collection. For over twenty years, Heather Ann Creations has specialized in designing a line of unique photo frames, wall decor and tabletop accessories with unusual finishes. Many products are reproductions of 18th and 19th century antique carvings from around the world. The products can be used throughout the home blending age-old tradition with today's contemporary interiors and exteriors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gWm+1WtCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heather Ann Creations","source_asin":"B01GPA55WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-899471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GPA55WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GPA55WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
