window.products.push({"id":899744,"name":"Ganz U.S.A., LLC Nurses Live, Love, and Inspire Hope Butterfly Charm for Nurses, Joyful Everyday Ornament Gift Ornament, Hanging Home Decor| Presented","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UlnkZPSyL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Butterflies are deep and powerful representations of life. Several cultures associate the butterfly with our souls. Around the world, people view the butterfly as representing endurance, change, hope. The Christian religion sees the butterfly as a symbol of resurrection. Features:  Exquisite design Casting Good Vibes Superior quality material Includes a white colored ribbon Keepsake gift for your loved ones Measurements:  Butterfly: 2.25\" wide & 2.5\" long Ribbon: 2 ½\" long Color:  Butterfly: Silver & Gold (Body), Blue & Yellow (Colored Gems) Ribbon: White Material used:  Butterfly: Made from Zinc Ribbon: Organza cloth stuff Package includes:  1 Butterfly ornament with a white organza ribbon loop 1 Festive and sparkly fun bag 1 Solid white gift box Why buy Butterfly hanging ornament? This happy thoughts ornament is proven to put a smile on your Nurse' or any receiver's faces not only during happy occasions but also in difficult times. Just make your Nurse smile by giving her this Butterfly Everyday Ornament! It is a double-sided Butterfly everyday ornament that represents happiness & prosperity, with a \"Nurses live, love, and inspire hope\" message on the dangling charm. The hanging ornament will sparkle in the light. This ornament will arrive fully wrapped in a festive and sparkly fun bag. It can also be hanged with the photos on a wall, window, or a jewelry tree. This hanging ornament is a great token for any season or occasion. Butterfly trinket will make any Nurse in your life feel more appreciated! So, click on a \"Add to cart\" button and add a touch of serenity to your loved one's life by gifting them on special days or occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UlnkZPSyL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ganz","source_asin":"B08C7KWYZ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-899744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C7KWYZ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C7KWYZ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
