window.products.push({"id":899875,"name":"\"Kissing Bell\" Place Card/Photo Holder (Set Of 24) , 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W88Maw1DL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bells will ring joyfully on your wedding day, when a single kiss at the altar changes your life forever! Give your guests__and yourselves__the pleasure of reliving the moment over and over again with our \"Kissing Bell\" Place Card/Photo Holder with a braided-heart handle. A sweet poem on the back of the place cards invites guests to \"ring\" for a kiss from the happy couple. Start smooching! Features and facts: Sweet, silver-finish metal bell place card/photo holder with braided, openwork heart handle. Bell measures 1 3/4\" h x 1 1/4 \" in diameter. Coordinating place cards included. One side of place card has space for a name, the other side is imprinted with this poem: \"Today, as we gather together, wish us a love to last forever. If you would like us to share a wedded kiss, ring the bell for lifelong bliss\". Sold in a set of 24.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W88Maw1DL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate Aspen","source_asin":"B00EAAF998","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-899875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EAAF998","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EAAF998","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
