window.products.push({"id":899924,"name":"Taubathe Bed Queen King Sheet & Pillowcases Set - 4 Piece Set - Microfiber with 16\" Deep Extra Soft for Hotel Dorm Room, White/Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qai+KmbXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☛Supreme Quality☚ Soft sheets made of microfiber fabric, which is composed of extremely fine fibers of polyester. They resist pilling more than traditional polyester fabric does. With exquisite tech and excellent air permeability, microfiber bring enjoyment to users; professional and beautiful design of our bed sheet sets blended bedroom well. Different from other material, microfiber is thicker and strengthened for adequate sleep. Purchase wisely would help you enjoy benefits for a long time. ☛Luxury Line☚ Luxury 4 bed Sheet Sets includes 90\"x102\" Flat Sheet, 60\"x80\" x16 \" Sheet, two 20\" x30\" Pillowcases. Even 16 inches deep mattress is also available with elastic bands around the sheets. These sheets grip and fit your bed better than any other sheet set! The bed sheet set is designed to fit almost any mattress up to 16\". With elasticity and durable elasticity, the bed sheets are aimed of comfort and fitness. ☛Supreme Workmanship☚ You may have heard that the higher the thread count, the softer the sheets. Made of 1800 thread count Series Ultra-Soft Double Brushed microfiber fabric, our bed sheet sets are woven with exquisite tear-resistant tech. Strong, stain-resistant, skin friendly, allergenic, smooth, soft, and breathable—a great choice for a luxurious night's sleep. A hypoallergenic one will help prevent any side effects like allergic reactions or rashes. ☛Simple Care☚ Suitable for multiple mattresses. Preventing discoloration, staining, shrinkage and wrinkling, our luxury bed sheets are durable, machine-washed in cold water and dried quickly in tube. To keep your sheets in tip-top condition, wash them in warm water and avoid drying them in high heat. And, while it may seem like a smart idea to use laundry softener to make your sheets even cozier, the chemicals in fabric softeners can actually wear out the material faster. ☛Best Return Service☚ we accept returns for any reason and at any time. Our bed sheets have marked the batch number in the washing label. You can timely feedback to us with any bed sheets quality problems , and we can carry out tracking batch correction and re-issue qualified products to you. This is our confidence in product quality and commitment to customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qai+KmbXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Taubathe","source_asin":"B09LR4W1XC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-899924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LR4W1XC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LR4W1XC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
